=== CEDO204  gold 6 panels / Claude 5  (CEDO204_0_0.html)
   gold crumbs  : Intro | Bird nests | Beaver dams and lodges | Insect builders | Spiders | Designing structures | Animals like birds, beavers and spiders are amazing builders. In this module, we will explore some of the cool structures that animals create, like nests, dams, lodges, burrows and webs. Humans design and build incredible structures too. Looking at structures that animals build can give us ideas for our buildings. By understanding how other animals work, we can learn a lot about design, construction and problem-solving. Through hands-on activities and creative challenges, you will get to learn, experiment, design and create, making this unit a fun and exciting adventure in science and technology!
